<title>SOUTH KOREA: Nongshimga to buy shares of Nong Shim.</title>
<headline>Nongshimga to buy shares of Nong Shim.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1997-03-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Korea's Nongshimga Co Ltd said on Wednesday it would buy 450,000 shares of its sister firm Nong Shim Co Ltd to strengthen its managerial rights.</p>
<p>The unlisted distribution company said in a statement its stake in Nong Shim would increase to 17.78 percent with the purchase from 4.44 percent.</p>
<p>The purchase was scheduled for March 25 to April 14 and the purchase price was set at 59,000 per share.</p>
<p>-- Seoul Newsroom (822) 727 5644</p>
